      },
      "payload": {
        "progress": "Fix A: SpeculativeTranscriptCapture gained baselineTranscriptRef (the session.transcript_ref observed at speculative-read time); resolveTranscriptCapture now requires BOTH session id AND that baseline to match the authoritative session before reusing the speculative result, else falls back to an in-lock capture (whose own Fix-2 preserve-existing behavior does the right thing). Fix B: stop.ts and review.ts now pre-validate state (assertStoppable / checkReviewEntry) against the unlocked initialTicket BEFORE speculativeTranscriptCapture runs, so a command that's clearly going to fail never mutates .slop/transcripts/. done.ts/drop.ts were checked and don't need this -- their state invariants mean checkDoneEntry/checkDropEntry can never fail while active_session is set. 3 new regression tests (transcript.test.ts race test, stop.test.ts + review.test.ts never-mutate-on-failed-validation tests). Full suite: 1753/1753 pass; typecheck/lint/format clean."
      },
      "at": "2026-07-24T20:05:45.652Z"
    },
